The proposed mortgage would result in a monthly housing payment of approximately $4,207.78. Combined with existing debt obligations of $2,900.00, the total monthly debt service would be $7,107.78, leaving only $3,042.22 (30% of gross income) for all other living expenses, taxes, savings, and discretionary spending.

