3. The application has already been processed with a final decision timestamp of 2025-12-16T08:22:28Z - re-processing may create duplicate entries.
4. The DTI ratio of 67.29% exceeds the institutional maximum of 43% for Qualified Mortgage compliance.
5. The probability of default score of 99.66% is extremely high, mapping to Credit Grade D.
6. The turnaround time of 180 days exceeds the target of 25 days significantly.
7. The application lacks final_appraised_value and loan_to_value_ratio fields that should be calculated.

c. Ambiguous parts interpretation:
