4. Credit reports must be pulled from all three bureaus using the FICO Score Tri-Merge Middle Score Methodology.
5. Pre-qualification screening compares credit scores against thresholds and calculates preliminary DTI ratios.
6. Underwriting involves detailed verification of employment, income, assets, and comprehensive credit analysis.
7. Property valuation requires appraisal ordering, site inspection, comparable sales analysis, and AVM validation.
