The application demonstrates strong compensating factors including substantial reserves (74.12 months), excellent credit history, and stable long-term employment, which offset the elevated DTI ratio. All regulatory requirements have been met, and the loan is approved subject to satisfaction of two outstanding conditions prior to closing.
