The application does not meet the institution's credit underwriting standards as outlined in the SOP, particularly regarding debt-to-income ratio limits, credit quality thresholds, and probability of default parameters. No compensating factors were present to offset the elevated risk indicators. The decision is consistent with regulatory requirements and institutional risk management objectives.

All outputs have been documented in the Loan Origination System per SOP Section 6 requirements, including comprehensive metrics, decision rationale, and compliance monitoring data.
