- Prequalification analysis completed with "Not Qualified" decision due to high DTI (51.3%)
- Attempts to proceed to underwriting verification failed as expected for "Not Qualified" applications
- The application shows strong credit (811), good income ($15,300/month), substantial assets ($158,000 liquid), but the requested loan amount creates unsustainable debt burden
