3. The requested loan amount ($375,000) significantly exceeds the max_loan_amount_prequalified ($186,722.51).
4. The application already has some appraisal data (site inspection completed), suggesting some steps were initiated despite pre-qualification failure.
5. The SOP requires judgment on whether to proceed with underwriting for marginal cases near thresholds.

c. Ambiguous parts interpretation:
