- Processing completed: 2025-12-16T10:51:50Z
- Turnaround time: 217 days (excessive due to appraisal being unnecessarily ordered)
- The property appraisal was ordered on 2025-05-17 and completed on 2025-05-20, which should not have occurred for a "Not Qualified" application per SOP guidelines.

**Compliance**: This decision complies with Regulation Z (Truth in Lending Act) and the Ability-to-Repay requirements under Dodd-Frank. The excessive DTI ratio indicates the loan would not meet Qualified Mortgage standards.
