   - First Pass Yield: True (approved without conditions on initial review)
   - Fair Lending Audit: Flagged for review (decline with score >700 requires examination)

5. **Compliance Notes**:
   - The application was processed in accordance with all regulatory requirements
   - Fair lending monitoring identified this decline for additional review due to high credit score
   - All calculations and decisions documented for audit trail purposes

The application has been fully processed through all applicable SOP phases. The decline decision is consistent with institutional credit policy thresholds for debt-to-income ratios, which represent a fundamental underwriting standard that cannot be waived despite otherwise strong applicant qualifications.
