- Substantial reserves ($165,500 after purchase)
- High liquid assets
- No derogatory marks

The SOP states in 5.1.6: "though marginal cases near the threshold may warrant consideration of whether the overall profile suggests alternative product structures or exception processing"

Given that appraisal activities have already been completed, I should proceed with the property valuation phase and then evaluate compensating factors.
