    - Funded status: False

The application processing followed SOP guidelines appropriately. The "Not Qualified" status prevented further underwriting verification and property appraisal, which is consistent with business logic to avoid unnecessary work on applications that fail preliminary screening. The decline decision is justified based on the combination of high probability of default, excessive debt-to-income ratio, and insufficient assets.
