Results from ExecutePrequalificationAnalysis:
- prequalification_decision: "Not Qualified"
- preliminary_debt_to_income_ratio: 54.18%
- institutional threshold for back-end DTI: 43% (from SOP definitions)
- The DTI of 54.18% significantly exceeds the 43% threshold
- max_loan_amount_prequalified: $187,135.64 (much lower than requested $360,000)
- preliminary_ltv_ratio: 77.42%

The SOP states: "ratios significantly exceeding maximum permissible levels generating 'Not Qualified' designations." This application clearly falls into this category.
