The SOP mentions in 5.2.8 that compensating factors analysis should be conducted when DTI exceeds standard thresholds. Given that appraisal activities have already occurred, I should proceed to analyze credit history and calculate debt ratios to determine if compensating factors could justify proceeding.

I will continue with AnalyzeCreditHistory as the next logical step per SOP 5.2.4, even though the application is technically "Not Qualified" in prequalification phase.
