Critical Issue: The application received a "Not Qualified" prequalification decision with a DTI of 76.04%, far exceeding the institutional maximum thresholds (typically 28% front-end, 43% back-end for Qualified Mortgage compliance). According to SOP 5.1.6, applications with ratios significantly exceeding maximum permissible levels generate "Not Qualified" designations. This suggests the application should not proceed to full underwriting.

