Based on the Standard Operating Procedure, the mortgage loan application for Larry Dean Murphy has been processed through the Mortgage Application Intake and Pre-qualification Phase (Section 5.1 of the SOP). The application has failed pre-qualification and cannot proceed to the Credit Underwriting Phase.

Key Findings:
